# Line endings are a repo policy, not a per-clone accident. run.sh is the add-on
# entrypoint and a CRLF shebang asks the kernel for `bash\r`; and
# panel/dist/.source-hash is a sha256 over source BYTES, so a CRLF working tree
# reports a stale bundle. eol=lf, not just text=auto: the hash is computed over
# the working tree, not the index.
* text=auto eol=lf

